<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Consol in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Consol in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper and packaging firm Consol said on Friday that talks were in progress which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on its equity instruments.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders and subordinated convertible debenture holders to exercise caution when dealing in their equity instruments until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
